{"steam_appid":2416100,"steam_name":"Goodnight Universe","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2416100/114822753/0c12256e4feb1edd7ae5b862ed2eb9ecf2df66a1/1762816278/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762880353","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257229341/9b62a1db386b2ad6b5eeb19bebed0d4f5d2f457a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762880353","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416100/ss_1270824949378653dbc9c7e7fa98c33754d7b110.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783634621","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416100/ss_77d2d6bf15c0203536cfd26f55cd231febef6e0e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783634621","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416100/ss_569eab33678df9f6baa03d50abff89ea51002184.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783634621","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416100/ss_f678c1ba888e8debd626055ec38628cfae52ea94.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783634621","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416100/ss_23a7e2b25fc2342d45a3857cc080a280ba2d0b38.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783634621"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <i>Before Your Eyes</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416100/extras/d76ce4ba31b3a7bbc75cf548254ceebb.avif?t=1783634621\" width=616 height=538 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Isaac, a 6-month-old baby, developing mysterious psychic powers. What you want most is to be loved and accepted by your family, but a secretive tech corporation wants you for their own. The game features an immersive “camera as controller” mode, expanding on the innovative use of camera-based technology that the development team is known for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img